(b) Work undertaken before certification. Any work undertaken prior to submission of these certifications shall be at the permit holder's risk.
(c) Review by county administrator; failure to certify or make correction. The county administrator shall review the above referenced certification data submitted. Deficiencies detected by such review shall be corrected by the permit holder immediately and prior to further progressive work being allowed to proceed. Failure to submit certification or failure to make said corrections required hereby shall be cause to issue a stop-work order for the project.
